### Test 3 — Suscripción básica (dolly): solo el idioma elegido inicialmente + bloqueo 1 año / pago
@baseUrl = http://localhost:57011/api/v1
@email = qa-test3-{{$timestamp}}@example.com
@password = QaPassword123!

### 3.1 Registro y activación plan dolly
# @name reg
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "fullName": "QA Basic Lang"
}

@token = {{reg.response.body.data.tokens.accessToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tier": "dolly"
}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categories": ["gastronomia"]
}

### 3.2 Intentar seleccionar 2 idiomas en plan básico -> 400 SUBSCRIPTION_LANGUAGE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/languages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "languages": ["fr", "en"]
}

### 3.3 Seleccionar francés como idioma único -> 200 OK
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/languages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "languages": ["fr"]
}

### 3.4 Generar en francés -> 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "gastronomia",
  "language": "fr",
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "size": "short"
}

### 3.5 Intentar generar en inglés/español/italiano -> 403 SUBSCRIPTION_LANGUAGE_NOT_ALLOWED
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "gastronomia",
  "language": "en"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "gastronomia",
  "language": "es"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "gastronomia",
  "language": "it"
}

### 3.6 Intentar cambiar a español sin pagar ni cumplir 1 año -> 403 LANGUAGE_CHANGE_LOCKED
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/languages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "languages": ["es"]
}

### 3.7 Pagar desbloqueo y cambiar a español -> 200 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/settings/languages/unlock-change
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/languages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "languages": ["es"]
}

### 3.8 Español funciona (201) y francés ahora falla (403 SUBSCRIPTION_LANGUAGE_NOT_ALLOWED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "gastronomia",
  "language": "es",
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "size": "short"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "gastronomia",
  "language": "fr"
}
